


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_a15d0eee:


    "长长的一吻后，二人的身心都达到了足够的炙热。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_70b1dc3d:


    "毫不犹豫的脱掉所有衣物。对于现在的两人来说，一块薄布都是阻碍。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6d4ed101:


    "踢开床上多余的内衣和衬衫，二人肌肤相贴。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_4e1d3c3e:


    "暂时停下手上的动作，两人互相确认一般呼唤着对方的名字，注视对方。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_46267547:



    voice "d/2FU_1050"
    fumi "「要是又没做好怎么办……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_3748b879:


    "阳菜再次甩开头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_7db385e9:



    voice "d/2HI_1311"
    hina "「无所谓的……只要是和小文做，怎样都会觉得开心」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_c81ba74f:



    voice "d/2FU_1051"
    fumi "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_1625e8fd:


    "阳菜伸出手，与文伸过来的手十指交缠。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6d54c2d8:


    "没错，只要两人在一起就怎么做都是对的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_70600f3d:



    voice "d/2HI_1312"
    hina "「但是我果然还是想让小文觉得舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_30834e06:


    "阳菜一边说着一边握紧了文的手。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_0150829e:



    voice "d/2FU_1052"
    fumi "「阳菜的样子好帅气」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_3acea935:



    voice "d/2HI_1313"
    hina "「是、是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_05648b17:



    voice "d/2FU_1053"
    fumi "「我也想让阳菜有感觉，但如果能一起舒服起来的话就更好了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_657a52ad:


    "如此碎语出声时文魅惑地微笑着。使得阳菜仿佛背后流过电流一般。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_250395b5:



    voice "d/2HI_1314"
    hina "「小文的样子好色情」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_d14a5031:



    voice "d/2FU_1054"
    fumi "「色……！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_b01b2550:



    voice "d/2HI_1315"
    hina "「不是指不好的方面……是指让我心跳加速」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_bd970ad8:



    voice "d/2FU_1055"
    fumi "「那、那倒——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_c35d2fa4:


    hina_fumi "「呀啊！？」\n「哎啊！？」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_c8636a63:


    "两人同时叫出声来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_f2cab6c1:


    "准确来讲是文先叫出了声，接着阳菜也叫了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_4d054b03:



    voice "d/2FU_1057B"
    fumi "「啊、那个……那里好像有什么热热的东西落下来……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_4eec1d4d:



    voice "d/2HI_1317"
    hina "「哎？热的……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_33af40c4:


    "阳菜低下头看了看。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_d40ac05b:



    voice "d/2FU_1058"
    fumi "「阳菜……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_4bbe9bc6:



    voice "d/2HI_1318"
    hina "「那个……热的东西是我的爱液……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_1211bcb5:



    voice "d/2FU_1059"
    fumi "「哎呀……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_69b7d62c:



    voice "d/2HI_1319"
    hina "「看着小文……不知什么时候就变成这样了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_209f0875:


    "然后就滴落下来了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_2d59c7ea:



    voice "d/2HI_1320"
    hina "「好丢人啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_d841a5cb:



    voice "d/2FU_1060"
    fumi "「没有……我肯定也是」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_9a1f9ebc:


    "文尴尬的笑了下后紧了紧彼此交缠在一起的手。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_a6967aa1:



    voice "d/2HI_1321"
    hina "「我们把舒服的地方贴在一起吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_3141d4f7:



    voice "d/2FU_1061"
    fumi "「嗯、好」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_bc86243f:


    "文同意了阳菜突然的提议。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_89aafc49:



    voice "d/2HI_1322"
    hina "「这个地方可是我们俩身上反应最直接的地方」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_29e88a43:



    voice "d/2FU_1062"
    fumi "「………请对我做你想做的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_73739278:


    "两人视线交织确认心意。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_ee5f9e30:


    "很自然的，将彼此最炙热的地方重叠在了一起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_4f316222:


    hina_fumi "「呀啊！？」\n「哈啊！？」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_9f612ef0:


    "两人再次叫出声来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_13ef83f4:


    "这次是完全同时的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_f1e47e66:



    voice "d/2HI_1324"
    hina "「好烫……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_94c63864:



    voice "d/2FU_1064"
    fumi "「阳菜的……吸在一起了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_eec58888:


    "两人都很惊讶的看着对方。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_44f969fa:



    voice "d/2HI_1325"
    hina "「这个……好像很厉害啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_53d0a3b7:



    voice "d/2FU_1065"
    fumi "「嗯、是……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_1a1fbcb8:


    "偶然？不对，这是必然的大发现。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_62b1afbe:



    voice "d/2HI_1326"
    hina "「我可以……继续下去吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_9d0c7a60:



    voice "d/2FU_1066"
    fumi "「嗯……再多做些」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_e9bdf070:


    "面对以前从未体验到的快感，身心都无法自拔了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_1b4ffe46:


    "屋里回响着床嘎吱嘎吱晃动的声音，以及两人粗重的喘息声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_562a2c2d:



    voice "d/2FU_1067"
    fumi "「好厉害的声音」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6ecd2d3e:


    "接合的部位传出淫靡的水声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_b6ec148b:


    "两人的粘膜紧贴在一起，相互交融。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_14ea5d7d:


    "牵出爱液后，重复着分开贴合的动作。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_74a5f6fa:


    "一浪高过一浪，这是属于两人的新的世界。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_70152213:



    voice "d/2FU_1068"
    fumi "「明明很害羞……却停不下来」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_251996ee:


    "最开始只有阳菜一人在动，但现在文也忘我地扭动起腰肢。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6d22b8e0:



    voice "d/2HI_1327"
    hina "「嗯……嗯嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_faee45ed:


    "不管是呼吸重合时……"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_b4b7da76:



    voice "d/2FU_1069"
    fumi "「不……哈啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_648014c6:


    "还是交错时……"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_c9c13916:


    hina_fumi "「啊啊……啊啊嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_400b289c:


    "一轮一轮巨大的快感和合为一体的感觉不停地冲击着两人。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_046687e4:


    "忘我到完全不在乎贴到脸颊与额头上的发丝，互相争抢着摆动腰部。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_8719778e:


    "洒下的汗水，在夕阳下映出了光泽。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_da9d56ff:



    voice "d/2HI_1329"
    hina "「抱歉……我们俩的汗和爱液把小文的床弄湿了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_793cd7fc:



    voice "d/2FU_1071"
    fumi "「没事，床单换一下就好……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_d2f09b2a:


    "不是单方面在享受，而是双方都在享受着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_87308340:


    "很有阳菜和文风格的自然而然地找到了方法。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_0029abe0:



    voice "d/2FU_1072"
    fumi "「啊……那里好棒……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6967a9ce:



    voice "d/2HI_1330"
    hina "「嗯嗯……我也是……那里好喜欢！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6585707b:


    "二人的动作本是杂乱无章的，在找到彼此的点时开始有了目的性。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_ccbd4524:


    "互相摩擦彼此高扬的花蕊。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_8629b909:


    "发现了最高效获得快感的技巧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_ce30eb0f:



    voice "d/2HI_1331N"
    hina "「啊啊……小、小文……！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_3686a7c6:




    voice sustain 
    voice "d/2FU_1073"
    fumi "「阳啊……嗯嗯嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_676b21b2:



    voice sustain
    "电流从身体中心直窜至头顶，两人止不住的颤抖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_337b405c:



    voice "d/2HI_1332"
    hina "「大脑……一片空白……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_fae152e7:



    voice "d/2FU_1074"
    fumi "「我也……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_091390df:


    "腰肢的摆动不断加速，然后在到达顶点时静止。柔软的快感之源在重压下变了形。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_a1bd5af6:


    "两人深吸一口气，挺直身体，"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_a9bd49ee:


    "迎来绝顶。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_219f4aed:


    hina_fumi "「啊、啊……哈啊嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_52ba28fe:



    voice sustain
    "这已经是今天不知第几次的共鸣了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_956a6919:


    "阳菜下面喷洒出来的液体落到文的小腹上，留下了一小滩水渍。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_ea8b0e45:


    "文也慢慢放松身体，松开了已经握皱了的床单。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_697e4c55:



    voice "d/2HI_1335"
    hina "「小……文……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_65089b65:



    voice "d/2FU_1075"
    fumi "「阳菜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_8707e9a5:


    "爱意满满的呼唤彼此的名字，两人静静地在床单的海面上着陆。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_92b72260:



    voice "d/2HI_1336"
    hina "「好痛……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_6a73f4ba:


    "呼吸平稳下来后阳菜叫出声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_c1150059:



    voice "d/2FU_1076"
    fumi "「哎……痛？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_330feb6a:



    voice "d/2HI_1337"
    hina "「啊……不是，不是那里」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_72b47de5:


    "阳菜摇了摇握在一起的手。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_73ef5c58:



    voice "d/2FU_1077"
    fumi "「真的……指尖都变白发冷了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_cad70fac:



    voice "d/2HI_1338"
    hina "「抱歉，手指是不是很痛？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_51381e02:



    voice "d/2FU_1078"
    fumi "「没，没关系……不要松开，再这样握一会儿」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_e82bb42a:


    "文抓住阳菜要松开的手。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_1dfbad0d:



    voice "d/2HI_1339"
    hina "「嗯……不松开」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_a511dc89:


    "阳菜笑着又握了回去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_3586917b:


    "不再说些什么，只是注视着彼此。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_0a34fbb0:


    "无所谓自然不自然，现在两人合为了一体。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_41892a4c:


    "终于找到了两人的最适解。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_a42f5565:


    "沉浸在满足感中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_72dff258:



    voice "2HI_1340"
    hina "「越来越不想放开你了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_e5232993:


    "阳菜这么说着，又凑近了文一些。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_7650bdfe:


    "文透过肌肤察觉到了音色上带着的些许不安。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_62467678:


    "再次出现的那份对终结的不安。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_6ff46544:


    "现在得到的幸福越多，就越害怕失去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_f119a022:



    voice "2FU_1079"
    fumi "「喂，阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_eb61e366:


    "文温柔的用手指梳理好阳菜凌乱的头发。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_b772b9c7:



    voice "2FU_1080"
    fumi "「以前阳菜说过会和我一起相信天使的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_d9937b96:


    "阳菜点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_ca6dbafe:



    voice "2FU_1081"
    fumi "「我很高兴你会那么说，这句话让我得到了莫大的鼓舞」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_f3d3787c:



    voice "2FU_1082"
    fumi "「现在如果是阳菜感到不安的话，就由我来带着你走——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_79346c79:



    voice "2HI_1341"
    hina "「……小文」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_f7d0f5ac:



    voice "2FU_1083"
    fumi "「没关系，一起去相信我们的未来吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene02_end_7d94e1da:



    voice "2HI_1342"
    hina "「嗯！」"
